s February and May in red to draw focus.","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*40IthwWnfD91UJ4LAjeQDA.png","line":19,"embedded":true},{"title":"**Get friend links for all of our 1000> Power BI learning articles here**","target":"https://powerbi-masterclass.short.gy/learning-database?utm_source=medium&utm_medium=medium-post&utm_campaign=database-medium-post-start","line":29},{"title":"Side-by-side pie charts showing sales by product category — the left chart uses many random colors, while the right emphasizes Computers, Cameras, and Camcorders with bold color to show they make up over 50% of sales.","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*7nKhiDZO8yz9toiryUrAGA.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"Line chart showing number of deaths on Mount Everest by cause — all categories use bright, similar colors, making it difficult to interpret","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*BnjSnqcHqKJerT-QKQyBMg.png","line":47,"embedded":true},{"title":"Line chart of Everest deaths by cause — one category (e.g., route preparation) is highlighted in red while others are muted, clearly guiding attention to the most significant insight.","target":"https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:1400/format:webp/1*lDSai4z2KXyitrsngVOqZg.png","line":54,"embedded":true},{"title":"What is 3–30–300 Rule?","target":"https://medium.com/@mdrahmanmizan/the-3-30-300-rule-changed-the-way-i-build-dashboards-91f261df3780","line":72},{"title":"Lets know more about the 3–30–300 Rules.","target":"https://medium.com/@mdrahmanmizan/the-3-30-300-rule-changed-the-way-i-build-dashboards-91f261df3780","line":79},{"title":"Power BI Newsletter","target":"https://medium.com/microsoft-power-bi/newsletters/microsoft-power-bi-weekly","line":85},{"title":"Microsoft Power BI Masterclass | Linktree","target":"https://linktr.ee/powerbi.masterclass?source=post_page-----04f4070419f2---------------------------------------","line":89}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"99.System/InboxArchive/2026-08/The Color Trap What Most Dashboards Get Wrong.md"},
